msgid "plugins.generic.citationChecker.name"
msgstr "Citation Checker"

msgid "plugins.generic.citationChecker.description"
msgstr "Checks a paper's reference list: each DOI's validity, presence in Crossref and match to the reference, retracted or withdrawn works, DOI suggestions for Latin-script references that lack one (added in one click), gaps in Arabic references (author, title, publisher, year), duplicates and alphabetical order. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

